sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Клиентское приложение
    participant Server as Codex App-Server (stdio)
    participant Core as Движок & Модель

    Note over Client,Server: 1. Рукопожатие (Handshake)
    Client->>Server: initialize {clientInfo, capabilities}
    Server-->>Client: initialized {protocolVersion: "0.160.0", serverCapabilities}

    Note over Client,Server: 2. Управление веткой (Thread)
    Client->>Server: thread/create {workspacePath, profile}
    Server-->>Client: thread/created {threadId: "th_12345"}

    Note over Client,Server: 3. Исполнение очереди (Turn Execution)
    Client->>Server: turn/start {threadId: "th_12345", message: "Исправь баг в auth.py"}
    Server->>Core: Запуск рассуждений модели

    loop Потоковые события (Turn Events)
        Core-->>Server: Инкремент текста / вызов tool
        Server-->>Client: event: turn/event {delta: "Анализирую auth.py..."}
        Server-->>Client: event: turn/event {tool_call: "read_file", path: "auth.py"}
        Server-->>Client: event: turn/event {tool_result: "OK", lines: 120}
    end

    Core-->>Server: Модель завершила генерацию
    Server-->>Client: event: turn/completed {status: "COMPLETED", usage: {tokens: 450}}

    Note over Client,Server: 4. Отмена или завершение (Cancellation / Shutdown)
    opt Пользователь нажал Отмена
        Client->>Server: turn/cancel {threadId: "th_12345"}
        Server-->>Client: event: turn/cancelled
    end
